					<h3>Partnership with the university of Papua New Guinea</h3>
					<p>The University of Papua New Guinea (UPNG) is a university located in Port Moresby,
						capital of Papua New Guinea. It was established by ordinance of the Australian
						administration in 1965. This followed the Currie Commission which had enquired into
						higher education in Papua New Guinea. The University of Papua New Guinea Act No. 18,
						1983 bill repealing the old Ordinance was passed by the National Parliament in
						August 1983.</p>
